wlanpi-webui (1.9.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add Packet Storm, a hidden Wi-Fi themed Asteroids game at /packetstorm,
    reachable from a dashboard tile and the Konami code from any page. Canvas
    2D only, no new dependencies, loaded only on the game page.
  * Make page headers consistent across the app: every page now has an
    eyebrow, title and lede, with data values set in mono.
  * Stack the Network and System refresh controls on narrow screens instead
    of overflowing the viewport, and unify button and select sizing.
  * Rework the latency graph: lazy-load Chart.js, follow the light/dark
    theme, tune the legend and ticks for mobile, and draw the first sample
    immediately instead of waiting for the next poll.
  * Move the error pages onto the design system.

