wlanpi-webui (1.7.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * UI redesign phase 2: session UX.
  * Persist the Flask session signing key (/var/lib/wlanpi-webui/session_key,
    created by postinst) so a service restart no longer signs users out.
  * Sign everyone out on reboot by comparing a boot id stored at login;
    fail open if the boot id cannot be read.
  * Add a 4h sliding idle timeout (WLANPI_WEBUI_IDLE_TIMEOUT); background
    polls (stats bar and nav menus) do not refresh it. Runs for every
    endpoint, including the nginx auth_request check.
  * Redirect to /login?reason=expired client-side when an htmx request comes
    back as the login page, instead of swapping it into the page.
  * Navbar user menu showing the signed-in user, a theme toggle and logout.
  * Add static/js/app.js with a shared wlanpiToast() helper, the theme
    toggle and the expiry redirect; use it for the service warnings.
  * Add session lifecycle tests.

